{"publicId":"0a3cd7e2-3c3a-4d8c-8145-9651d780215e","title":"东华大学团队通过白垩纪羽毛化石揭示鸟类飞行适应性分阶段进化","status":"watching","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:01.000Z","digest":"东华大学团队在《Gondwana Research》发表研究，通过3D重建和显微分析99万年前保存完整的白垩纪鸟类羽毛化石，发现其羽枝结构呈现从短绒状到长羽状的分阶段过渡，证实飞行适应性进化存在关键中间阶段【新】。此前学界多认为现代鸟类羽毛是突然演化的，而该研究通过化石形态连续性证据，支持了羽毛功能逐步优化的理论。研究样本为单件化石，未说明与其他白垩纪羽毛样本的对比分析。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-10T17:59:20.831Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"东华大学团队在 Gondwana Research 发表99万年前的羽毛揭示飞行适应性进化关键阶段","latestReport":{"id":"ljg1o7oq97iva780gfe2juuor"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fRzUG6v1MQ1U","title":"研究揭示9900万年前羽毛的进化线索","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"ljg1o7oq97iva780gfe2juuor","title":"东华大学团队在 Gondwana Research 发表99万年前的羽毛揭示飞行适应性进化关键阶段","summary":"东华大学团队在 Gondwana Research 发表99万年前的羽毛揭示飞行适应性进化关键阶段。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:01.000Z","selected":true}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"ljg1o7oq97iva780gfe2juuor","title":"东华大学团队在 Gondwana Research 发表99万年前的羽毛揭示飞行适应性进化关键阶段","summary":"东华大学团队在 Gondwana Research 发表99万年前的羽毛揭示飞行适应性进化关键阶段。","source":{"name":"Phys.org","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T17:30:01.000Z","selected":true}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-10T18:00:00.000Z","heat":9.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T19:00:00.000Z","heat":9.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T21:00:00.000Z","heat":9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T22:00:00.000Z","heat":8.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-10T23:00:00.000Z","heat":8.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T01:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T02:00:00.000Z","heat":7.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T03:00:00.000Z","heat":7.6,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T04:00:00.000Z","heat":7.4,"parti